From f38d873653578a00e43825b6b71ebdb0353c1c9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:19:08 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): make the ai_chat cancel test wait on the cancel
 flag, not a 5 s clock

The blocked test worker gave up after 5 s from turn start. A slow machine could
stall the UI thread longer, so the cancel never reached the worker. The worker
now waits for the flag and only a 120 s hang guard remains. A pin test stalls
6 s before the Cancel click.

Fixes #4021

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
